@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-usage
+
+OpenCode Go subscription usage panel for the DSH Web GUI, pinned below the sidebar's session list (the `sidebar.workspaces.footer` slot, between the "Show more sessions" overflow button and the sidebar foot).
+
+Registers a wide-only panel with the 5-hour/weekly/monthly quota meters — per-window percent readings, progress bars, and reset countdowns — under a compact title row, plus the refresh action and the updated-at timestamp. The panel stays mounted across session switches and renders nothing in the collapsed rail.
+
+Data comes from the same-origin bridge route `/api/opencode-go/usage` mounted by `@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-opencode-usage`; the widget polls once a minute.
