@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# @deepseek-ai/dsh-host-opencode-usage
+
+Same-origin bridge to [OpenCode Go](https://opencode.ai/docs/go/)'s official quota API.
+
+Mounts `GET /api/opencode-go/usage` on the DSH webserver. The route reads the Go bearer token from `~/.codex/config.toml` (`[model_providers.opencode].experimental_bearer_token`, or `OPENCODE_GO_TOKEN`), queries `https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1/usage`, and answers with the quota payload plus `fetchedAt`. The token never appears in a response.
+
+Upstream 401/403 responses and missing tokens carry a `message` field; upstream results are cached for 30 seconds.
